 - compatible: 	  The possible values are:
 		  "mediatek,mt2701-nor"
+		  "mediatek,mt2712-nor"
+		  "mediatek,mt7622-nor"
 		  "mediatek,mt7623-nor"
 		  "mediatek,mt8173-nor"
 		  For mt8173, compatible should be "mediatek,mt8173-nor".
